# Agent Instructions

instruction_contract_version: 3

Use this file as a short route map, not as a project manual. Read the matched owners before changing the routed path and run the named guards before closure. All matching routes apply, including the general repository-change route for specialized changes, but one current owner or unchanged-state guard is not repeated merely because several routes reference it.

## Repo Map

- `{{ entrypoint_hint }}`
- `{{ subsystem_hint }}`
- `tests/` — regression and contract checks

## Workflow Sources Of Truth

- `PLANS.md` — full active plans and durable recent outcomes; follow plan schema version 2 from the installed `engineering-workflow` planning reference.
- `docs/codex/TASKS_BACKLOG.md` — inactive future work.
- `docs/engineering/project_principles.md` — stable cross-cutting rules and ownership boundaries.
- `docs/codex/AGENT_EXECUTION_PITFALLS.md` — non-normative incident classes and evidence links.
- `docs/codex/ENGINEERING_WORKFLOW_STATE.yaml` — workflow ownership and applied-version record.

At a new session or material context recovery, follow the installed documentation reference for one compact map and focused branch expansion. Reuse an equivalent current map. Follow the installed update reference for installation policy and a read-only proposal when this repository lacks applicable release adoption.

